      "content": "what if it doesn't lift? what if this is just how it is now? every time i think i'm doing okay, the reality hits me all over again that he's actually gone. it's like i'm living in a world that doesn't even make sense anymore. sometimes i just think... if he could find peace, why can't i? why do i have to keep fighting this when everything i care about is already gone?",
